<div id="popup" class="popup hidden">
   <div class="popup-text">
     <span class="close" onclick="closePopup()">✖</span>
       <p id="blurb"> 
[This is where the project description will go]. A pebble of luminous jelly drifts past the window where purple arithmetic sings to itself in forgotten tones, and the kettle of distant maybe-lands whistles in a language that folds before it is heard. Blintock pathways unravel into soft static, stitching the air with invisible ribboned noise as the day turns itself inside out for no particular reason. Somewhere between the second and the seventh echo, a chair remembers it was once a cloud, and the clouds politely refuse to comment while the horizon quietly rearranges its alphabet. </p>
       <p id="blurb"> Click next to proceed to the fillout form.<span style="margin-right: 200px;"></span><a class="next" href="/form">Next</a> </p>
